source: crates/surfaces/cli/src/main.rs
expression: command.clone().render_long_help().to_string()
---
Run static analysis passes over the compiled project

Usage: specforge analyze [OPTIONS] [PASS]

Arguments:
  [PASS]
          Analysis pass to run: all (default), coverage, contracts, or a pass an extension declares (`<extension>:<pass>`)

Options:
      --path <PATH>
          A path inside the project (the nearest directory at or above it holding specforge.json; none: the directory itself, with the default configuration)
          
          [default: .]

      --format <FORMAT>
          Output format: human or json
          
          [default: human]
          [possible values: human, json]

      --strict
          Fail (exit 1) on warnings as well as errors

      --test-results <TEST_RESULTS>
          Test-results report for proof-level verdicts (default: the project's specforge-report.json, written by `specforge collect`)

      --prove
          Verify declared bounds and claims with an SMT solver (z3)

      --prove-timeout <SECONDS>
          Seconds one solver call may take before it is stopped (with --prove)
          
          [default: 30]

      --min <MIN>
          Fail with a non-zero exit when proof coverage falls below this percentage (needs test results)

  -h, --help
          Print help
